# Semgrep exclusions — the single source of truth for what Semgrep
# does not scan in this repository (CI's security.yml relies on this
# file; local `semgrep scan` runs behave identically).
#
# This repository's PURPOSE includes containing deliberately
# vulnerable fixtures and adjudicated evaluation corpora — data whose
# job is to contain findings. Product code is cmd/ and internal/
# (excluding testdata); everything below is data, not shipped code.
#
# Excluded trees:
#   benchmark/          scanner benchmarks, labeled corpora, the R5
#                       held-out blind set, comparison corpora
#   docs/audit/         R3/R4/R5 evaluation corpora and raw run data
#   tests/demos/        deliberately vulnerable demo stacks
#   tests/fixtures/     adapter/parser input fixtures
#   demo/               the README demo stack (scan it with Aegis —
#                       that's the tutorial — not with Semgrep)
#   internal/regression/  regression fixtures loaded by Go tests
#   **/testdata/        Go test fixtures inside product packages
benchmark/
docs/audit/
tests/demos/
tests/fixtures/
demo/
internal/regression/
**/testdata/
